msgstr "&Afspelen vanaf bladwijzer"

#. Translators: Bookmark context-menu item; renames the selected bookmark.
#. Translators: Context-menu item; renames the selected jukebox entry (a custom display name, not the underlying file/folder name).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\bookmarkUI.py:432
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:9438
